a8373ff6265c21be1aef1b5ccd0a0b419887864e5609b99ef0af96cdb0079c3a099fbbd6242fc3e95f89bb5b096119bd3e3ef232741700cf05b33a079d6aba1f  10-touch-firmware.files
"